BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OOPS! All Garridge 2
DTSTART:20260423T223000
DTEND:20260423T223000
UID:2e1604e052c995f2e470c3c2106ee6b5@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Back to where it all started &lt\;3 Tie up your dancin&#x27\; 
 shoes and get ready for the second edition of OOPS! All Garridge\, another
  UKG focused jam sesh\, since we just had way too much fun the first time.
  Experts are saying it&#x27\;s gonna be the genre of the summer. Haters ar
 e saying there&#x27\;s no way that there&#x27\;s a niche for an all-garage
 \, all-trans party\, and I cannot wait to prove them wrong once again. We&
 #x27\;re stoked to welcome back DJ Miss\, one of the city&#x27\;s most nex
 test upest selectors and for good reason\, I swear she hasn&#x27\;t missed
  even once and has a knack for seamlessly serving once banger into the nex
 t. Touching down at Metamorphosis for the first time will be Disnthene\, f
 ounder of Exposure Therapy &amp\; Electrogasm\, beloved party projects wit
 h dance floor vivacity that knows no bounds. and Zellers\, of course. Vari
 ety is the spice of life\, we try to throw parties of different sizes at d
 ifferent pirce points without ever skimping on the soundtrack\, this one&#
 x27\;s a little more intimate\, a little bit closer\, let&#x27\;s all get 
 drunk as hell\, get to know one another and dance like crazy to some sense
 lessly joyous shit!! $10 online $20 doors 19+ ‍
LOCATION:DROM Taberna\, 458 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/oops-all-garridge-2
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
