 ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠙⠟⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀
 ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀
 ⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ inviting to the playground for her Ca
 nadian debut is NYC’s stallion &amp\; mistress\, DANIRO &amp\; The retur
 n of Montreal’s club princess GURAFIKU ! DANIRO (@ahighlysensitiveblackw
 oman) uses her body\, text and electronic music as a weapon\, key and soun
 dtrack to the future she wants to see. I WANNA BATTLE!! by DANIRO is a per
 formance series and direct response to the world as we know and see it tod
 ay. With that\, she explores the desires\, emotions and imaginations of a 
 woman of the night — channeling it through the decks and onto the dancef
 loor as her God-given right. GURAFIKU brings bold and vibrant energy to he
 r craft. Drawing deeply from her Afro-Caribbean heritage\, she fuses globa
 l rhythms such as Amapiano\, Konpa\, Zouk\, Shatta\, Gqom\, Kuduro\, Baile
  Funk\, Bouyon\, Afrobeats\, and Afro House with hip-hop\, R&amp\;B\, and 
 house—creating a sound uniquely her own. + we are safe in the hands of o
 ur very own local club conductors @litneyworldwide\, @ard1nlove5tar\, @mad
 ame.myles\, @officialkike April 24th @ Sound Machine Toronto\, the playgro
 und will be yours. PLURR (peace\, love\, unity\, respect &amp\; responsibi
 lity) always. Wear deodorant with aluminum in it pls &amp\; if you like to
  steal phones\, I dare you to pull up too !! Wicked poster illustration cr
 eated by @shyfuck ‍
LOCATION:Sound Machine\, 178 Bathurst St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/club-lotus
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
