BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SHANGO 3 YEAR ANNIVERSARY PARTY! WITH CHICAGO LEGEND Jamie 3:26\, 
 Kiki LeFreak &amp\; Iced Misto
DTSTART:20260425T220000
DTEND:20260425T220000
UID:7fa71f70abda45a06b40a3ea2dbf545a@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:SHANGO 3 YEAR ANNIVERSARY PARTY! WITH CHICAGO LEGEND JAMIE 3:2
 6\, KIKI LEFREAK AND ICED MISTO WOW THANK YOU SHANGO FAMILY for the best 3
  years of my life. I&#x27\;m so proud of what we have created\, let&#x27\;
 s keep building this beautiful community together. I LOVE YOU! SHANGO is T
 oronto’s favourite underground party for the freaks\, geeks\, queers\, d
 ancers and heads! This month we are back for one last dance at Cafeteria. 
 The dance floor of Chicago’s Jamie 3:26 is one in which music heads and 
 party goers alike can’t help but lose themselves in the rhythm. Driven b
 y his desire to provide a liberating outlet for people\, Jamie has garnere
 d recognition for his fiercely masterful selection. Touring globally and a
 sserting himself on lineups\, Jamie continues to flex his musical muscles 
 and push boundaries. Last year he graced the decks at Chicago’s Chosen F
 ew Festival\, Defected Croatia’s Nu Groove stage\, and the opening party
  of London’s new 15k venue to name but a few... and there are plenty mor
 e dancefloors anticipating his spark on the horizon. Groove is the feeling
  when it comes to Jamie’s sets – which he curates by embracing everyth
 ing from 30-year-old overlooked gems to scorching new tracks. Jamie’s pr
 oductions are just as memorable as his sets and as head of 3:26 records he
  continues to nurture his sound and future talent. No stranger to remix du
 ties\, Jamie’s recent spin on Glitterbox’s ‘Gonna Be Alright’ is a
 lready a staple in bag of respected selectors. Unapologetically authentic\
 , Jamie 3:26 embodies the future of Chicago House music. Supported by loca
 l DJs Iced Misto and Shango’s founder Kiki LeFreak @kikilefreak SHANGO i
 s a safe space. PLUR in full effect Peace Love Unity and Respect. NO judge
 ment\, homophobia\, racism\, sexual harassment or unwanted touching Thank 
 you to my Shango community for your continued support and your help in cre
 ating a safe and loving space for us to be free in! Tickets on resident ad
 visor link in bio @kikilefreak 10pm to LATE ‍
LOCATION:Cafeteria\, 1650 Dupont Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/shango-3-year-anniversary-party-with-chica
 go-legend-jamie-3-26-kiki-lefreak-iced-misto
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
