 ndulge in delicious brunch offerings while playing bingo with a twist\, ho
 sted by our fabulous drag artists serving Poké evolutions\, apology video
  energy\, and enough drama to crash the algorithm. Whether you are team Pi
 kachu or team Notes App apology\, this brunch is guaranteed to be messy in
  the best possible way. If the comments are turned off\, the apology is mo
 netized\, and Pikachu is judging you from across the room… this brunch i
 s for you 💅🥂⚡️ Date &amp\; Time: Saturday\, May 9th | 12:00 PM L
 ocation: Granite Brewery (245 Eglinton Ave E\, Toronto) Tickets: $15 Early
  Bird\, $20 GA Menu: A curated brunch buffet featuring all your favourite 
 items! The buffet includes coffee/tea\, salads and dessert! NOTE: Brunch i
 s not included in your ticket price. A $25 minimum spend is required\, and
  a 18% gratuity will be applied to all bills Age Requirement: This show is
  18+ Cast: Sucka Queen\, BILF &amp\; Nicki Nastasia! Get ready for a one-o
 f-a-kind Drag Brunch Bingo experience at Granite Brewery! Expect high-ener
 gy drag performances\, hilarious bingo rounds\, and fabulous prizes! Doors
  open at 11:30am! 🌟 What to Expect: ✨ Show-stopping drag performances
  from Sucka and others! 🎱 Bingo games with exciting prizes 💸 Please 
 remember to bring cash to tip the queens! 🪑 Communal seating – purcha
 se tickets in groups to be seated together 🚗 Free parking on-site Gathe
 r your friends\, pick your favorite Pokémon\, practice your best apology 
 video face\, and come ready to slay! ⚡️🎤🥂 Get your tickets now 
 – seats fill up fast! ‍
